      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So \"available in future release\" is an awkward status for our automation to set in this case! 💦\n\nOur minimum version for VRChat worlds has been 5.5 for quite some time. As such, worlds uploaded using Unity 5.4 or earlier will be prevented from loading starting with this release.",
