  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-04-30T21:58:56.542Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I am not sure what exactly is the problem but worlds uploaded on 5.3 seem to have all their shaders broken so they are bright pink and not rendered correctly in both eyes. \n\nSome worlds put you into a infinite reload loop showing you the world for a second before reloading it again.\n\nThe worlds seem to report 0B download size on the website as well as when downloading  in the game client it says the total size is 0B while still downloading normally.\n\nOddly some of these worlds seem to have strange world ID and the two tested where the ones that kept causing you to reload\n\nA list of worlds I tested where the following\n\nComedy Club by Vrchat\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wld_b4fc88e5-d4d9-4452-a620-6b2ba0429fb1\n\nForest Campsite by cubedparadox\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wld_c95b8313-8607-4437-a808-57bd86eef5a1\n\nTed Stage by cubedparadox (This world puts you into a reload loop)\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/o_talXe1rHTt\n\nWindlands by cubedparadox (This world also puts you into a reload loop)\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/o_nHz5AQOmi9",
